    ['text'=>'Tatakae. Fight.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Tatakae. Fight until your last breath.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The world is cruel. That\'s why we fight.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Until every last one of them is wiped from this earth.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I want every titan exterminated from this earth.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The price of freedom isn\'t cheap.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Living in fear is no way to live at all.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Look outside the walls. That\'s where we\'re going.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We don\'t have time to be afraid.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I am free.','author'=>'Eren Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'This world is cruel, and yet so beautiful.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The world is merciless, and it\'s also very beautiful.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you can\'t do anything, then it ends here. If you don\'t win, you die. If you win, you live.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I will not die. I cannot die. I promised.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m strong. Stronger than all of you. Extremely strong.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I can do this. I have to do this.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Fight. You have to fight.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t fight, you can\'t win.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If I can\'t, then I have no right to live.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The scarf — thank you for putting it around me.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather die a soldier than live as a coward.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll do whatever it takes to protect the people I love.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t let anyone else die in front of me.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'There are only so many lives I can value.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'My family is no more. The only one left for me is Eren.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Goodbye, Eren.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll see you later, Eren.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Thank you for wrapping it around me.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Fight. If you don\'t fight, you can\'t win.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We all carry the weight of those we couldn\'t save.','author'=>'Mikasa Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The people who have the ability to change something in this world all have the ability to abandon everything.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'He who would save mankind from monsters must first abandon his humanity.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you give up now, you\'ll lose everything that means anything to you.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Someone who can\'t sacrifice anything can never change anything.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The world is a cruel place, but also very beautiful.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I want to see the ocean. The flame waters. The fields of ice. The lands of sand.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'To overcome monsters, you must be willing to abandon your humanity.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'There\'s nothing waiting out there for us. But we still have to go.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'A heart can be lost only if you let it go.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you win, you live. If you lose, you die. Don\'t fight, and you can\'t win.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I want to see what lies beyond the walls.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We have to go outside, Eren.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Until I draw my last breath, I\'ll keep fighting.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I can be a coward if it keeps you all alive.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t run anymore.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t change anything if you don\'t risk something.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Knowledge is the greatest weapon we have.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We can\'t keep losing the ones we love. We have to fight back.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Anyone who doesn\'t sacrifice will not be able to change anything.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'What an odd feeling. To learn that the world I once dreamed of has been twisted into something terrible.','author'=>'Armin Arlert','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The only thing we\'re allowed to do is to believe that we won\'t regret the choice we made.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Give up on your dreams and die.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Whether you make the right choice or not is something only you can know after the fact.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'No one knows what the outcome will be. So choose whatever you\'ll regret the least.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The strong eat the weak. That\'s how it is.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t know which option you should choose. I could never advise you on that.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Stay calm. Always make the choice you\'ll regret the least.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The fallen will never come back. Carry their will forward.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Their lives weren\'t meaningless.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We can\'t see ahead, so we choose with no regrets.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Hand over your hearts. Carry on.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'When the time comes, I\'ll be the one to put him down.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Tch. What a pain.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes the right answer is the cruel one.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m just a soldier doing his job.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll take the bet. I\'m betting on you.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Stay focused. The mission is the only thing.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t lose your composure. That\'s how soldiers die.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'There\'s only one weapon women have in this world. Tears.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Trust your comrades. Don\'t trust your enemies.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you let your emotions drive you, you\'ll die.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Soldiers do not run away. The only allowed direction is forward.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Dedicate your hearts to the cause.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Forget about the past. Soldiers move forward.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Real courage is going into battle knowing you\'ll die.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Pain is the price of being alive.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Cleanliness, then everything else. Always.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Dedicate your heart.','author'=>'Levi Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Devote your hearts!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Shinzou wo Sasageyo! Dedicate your hearts!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If we don\'t keep moving forward, no one will know the world we used to live in.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'My soldiers, push forward! Push forward! My soldiers, scream! My soldiers, rage!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Whether the dead are honored will be determined by the living.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Soldiers, rage! Soldiers, scream! Soldiers, fight!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Onward! We will give our hearts to humanity.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If those who pioneer must be considered insane, that\'s fine. We charge!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Press on. Don\'t stop. Sacrifice yourselves for what we must do.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you intend to win, follow me!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Even if we die, we\'ll be the ones to give meaning to those who follow.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We are warriors. Right now, here, this is where we make our last stand.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Charge!','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If your mind can\'t keep up, your body will fall behind.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Hope cannot be given. It must be made.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Those who give up — even on a hopeless cause — should at least live with the consequences.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'A real leader knows when to bet everything.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Make your dreams worth dying for.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We fight for the people who will come after us.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If you choose to follow, do so willingly. Knowingly.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We Survey Corps die for those who are yet to be born.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Forward, forever forward. Wings of freedom.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Will you give up your dreams? Or will you keep moving forward?','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m sorry. The dead can\'t ask anything of us anymore. The living must decide what to do.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I have a dream. I have to keep going to make it real.','author'=>'Erwin Smith','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m a warrior. I have to do this.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m the one who deserves to die.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We just kept marching forward and never looked back.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t dwell on it. Just decide and move.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Some sins, you can\'t ever atone for.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If I die, at least it will be in battle, not running.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Forgive me. Forgive me. Forgive me.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I have to keep moving. There is no other path.','author'=>'Reiner Braun','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We all die in the end. Nothing matters but what you do before then.','author'=>'Zeke Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Life itself is the curse.','author'=>'Zeke Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes mercy is doing what no one else will.','author'=>'Zeke Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Suffering is hereditary. Stop the chain.','author'=>'Zeke Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I just wanted to play catch.','author'=>'Zeke Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Even meaningless games can give a life value.','author'=>'Zeke Yeager','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Push forward. Carry the lives that fell with us.','author'=>'Hange Zoë','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll see you on the other side, you bastards.','author'=>'Hange Zoë','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Even the smallest detail can change the world.','author'=>'Hange Zoë','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll buy you the time. Now go.','author'=>'Hange Zoë','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Dedicate your hearts! For humanity!','author'=>'Hange Zoë','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We have to keep observing, keep questioning, keep going.','author'=>'Hange Zoë','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'We can\'t keep losing without learning something.','author'=>'Jean Kirstein','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The strong always survive. Become one of them.','author'=>'Jean Kirstein','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'A leader has to be the one who chooses.','author'=>'Jean Kirstein','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Run away from your responsibility and you\'ll never grow.','author'=>'Jean Kirstein','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m just trying to stay alive — and so should you.','author'=>'Jean Kirstein','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes the best plan is the one you make in the next thirty seconds.','author'=>'Jean Kirstein','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Meat. That\'s all that matters right now.','author'=>'Sasha Blouse','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather live and eat than die hungry.','author'=>'Sasha Blouse','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll get back home, no matter what.','author'=>'Sasha Blouse','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Tell them — sorry. And thank you.','author'=>'Sasha Blouse','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Live with pride. Or die with pride.','author'=>'Ymir','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I live for myself.','author'=>'Ymir','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Get up. Don\'t beg. Stand on your own.','author'=>'Ymir','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'When I die, at least let it be with no regrets.','author'=>'Ymir','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather lose everything for someone I love than win without them.','author'=>'Ymir','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not a god, not a saint. I\'m just a person.','author'=>'Historia Reiss','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I will choose who I want to be.','author'=>'Historia Reiss','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If we don\'t decide for ourselves, someone else will.','author'=>'Historia Reiss','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I can be more than what they made me.','author'=>'Historia Reiss','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Stand up. The queen doesn\'t kneel to fate.','author'=>'Historia Reiss','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I want to go home — and then I want to fight back.','author'=>'Connie Springer','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not a coward. I just had to learn how to be brave.','author'=>'Connie Springer','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Even if I\'m scared, I\'m still here. Still fighting.','author'=>'Connie Springer','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Some people choose their place in this world. The rest of us just survive.','author'=>'Annie Leonhart','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m a warrior. I made a promise. I have to keep it.','author'=>'Annie Leonhart','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'I never wanted to be the kind of person I had to become.','author'=>'Annie Leonhart','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes you can\'t go home. Sometimes you have to make a new one.','author'=>'Annie Leonhart','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Strength alone doesn\'t save you. Choices do.','author'=>'Annie Leonhart','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Everyone\'s a slave to something.','author'=>'Kenny Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t be anything more than what you are if you\'re afraid of being yourself.','author'=>'Kenny Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Everyone needs to be drunk on something. Power, dreams, faith — pick one.','author'=>'Kenny Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Nothing in this world happens without a reason.','author'=>'Pixis','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'People are only able to fight when they have something to lose.','author'=>'Pixis','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'A society that doesn\'t pass on its lessons to its young is doomed.','author'=>'Pixis','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Live with no regrets. That\'s all anyone can ask.','author'=>'Marco Bott','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Even the smallest soldier is part of humanity\'s last hope.','author'=>'Marco Bott','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes you have to lose everything to find out who you are.','author'=>'Marco Bott','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'There are no good people or bad people. Only people who choose.','author'=>'Kenny Ackerman','source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Shinzou wo sasageyo!','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Wings of freedom — never folded.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If we don\'t fight, who will?','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The forest of giants doesn\'t care who you were.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Beyond the walls — that\'s where life begins.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'The ocean is real. So is everything we were never told.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'If history teaches us anything, it\'s that hatred has no end.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Today the dead taught us how to fight tomorrow.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Carry the will of the fallen — that is the soldier\'s oath.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],
    ['text'=>'Freedom is not given. It is taken.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Attack on Titan','category'=>'aot'],

    // ── bleach (116) ──
    ['text'=>'If miracles only happen once, what do you call the second one?','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'We fear that which we cannot see.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If I\'m going to be cut anyway, I\'d rather be cut going forward.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t want any victory if it means standing alone.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Even when stripped of everything, the will to protect remains.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll fight him alone. I don\'t care about being strong. I just want to win.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t lose sight of who you fight for.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not asking you to fight my battles. I\'m asking you to live.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Power isn\'t determined by your size, but by the size of your heart and dreams.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I am the king. You are the horse. Don\'t ever get that backwards.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t have a goddamn clue what\'s coming. But I\'ll fight anyway.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Even if I have to bleed for it, I\'ll protect them.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Getsuga Tensho.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Bankai.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If I had to choose between justice and my friends, I\'d break the law every time.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not afraid of dying. I\'m afraid of not being able to protect anyone.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t worry. I won\'t let you die.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather lose a hundred fights and protect one friend than win and stand alone.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Strength without purpose is just noise.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'My sword exists for the people behind me.','author'=>'Ichigo Kurosaki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'We, who do not know how blessed we are, do not deserve happiness.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pride was something you wear, not something that wears you.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If fate is a millstone, then we are the grist.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'There is nothing we can do but live.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t try to die. We are not the ones who decide that.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Stand. Just stand. That\'s the first move.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Death gives shape to life. Don\'t waste either.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Lend me a hand. Stand with me, one more time.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Soul Reaper or human — whoever you are, fight for someone.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I had pride. I learned it had to be earned.','author'=>'Rukia Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Admiration is the emotion farthest from understanding.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Knowledge stagnates without doubt.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Trust is the source of mistakes. Doubt is the source of survival.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'No one stands on the top of the world. Not you. Not me. Not even gods.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'But the unbearable vacancy of the throne in the sky… I will fill it.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I have never thought of any of you as more than pawns.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'The moment you think you see the truth is when you\'ve already lost.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'The most pitiful creature is the man who clings to a fixed idea.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pride and shame go hand in hand. Lose one and you lose both.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'From the moment of your birth, the gods chose nothing for you.','author'=>'Sosuke Aizen','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pride is a sword. Use it carefully.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'A noble\'s duty is to bear what others cannot.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I will break the rules, but I will not let them be broken twice.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If I were to break the law, I would do so in the name of love.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Strength is meaningless without honor.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Scatter, Senbonzakura.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Make no mistake — your pride will be your undoing.','author'=>'Byakuya Kuchiki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t see things from up top until you\'ve climbed there yourself.','author'=>'Renji Abarai','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll keep walking until you have to look up to me.','author'=>'Renji Abarai','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Howl, Zabimaru.','author'=>'Renji Abarai','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t lose. Not while she\'s watching.','author'=>'Renji Abarai','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If my back is to the wall, that just means there\'s nowhere left to run.','author'=>'Renji Abarai','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Strength is paid for in sweat. Anyone who says otherwise is lying.','author'=>'Renji Abarai','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'A king must lead the way, even into the fire.','author'=>'Toshiro Hitsugaya','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'A young captain who cannot control his own anger is no captain.','author'=>'Toshiro Hitsugaya','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Reign over the frosted heavens, Hyourinmaru.','author'=>'Toshiro Hitsugaya','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Age is no excuse. Capability is.','author'=>'Toshiro Hitsugaya','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If you must be a sword, then be the one that protects.','author'=>'Toshiro Hitsugaya','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Fighting is fun. Don\'t make it complicated.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'There is no such thing as a lost cause. There are only losers.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'When you\'re afraid of dying — that\'s when you\'re alive.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t need a reason to fight. I just need an opponent.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If you\'re scared to die, you\'ve never been alive.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Strength isn\'t about winning. It\'s about wanting another round.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Fight harder. The pain means you\'re learning.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Whether or not I\'m killing you, I\'ll enjoy it. That\'s the truth of battle.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m too stubborn to die.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pain is just pain. Get up.','author'=>'Kenpachi Zaraki','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If it can be lost, it was never yours.','author'=>'Kisuke Urahara','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Goodbyes are always painful. Even a final salute can shake you.','author'=>'Kisuke Urahara','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t sit on your hands and call it wisdom.','author'=>'Kisuke Urahara','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t take risks, you can\'t create a future. That\'s the rule.','author'=>'Kisuke Urahara','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t cut what you don\'t intend to keep.','author'=>'Kisuke Urahara','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Lightning strikes once. Be there.','author'=>'Yoruichi Shihouin','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Speed is a discipline. Train it like a craft.','author'=>'Yoruichi Shihouin','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t worry, kid. You\'ll get faster.','author'=>'Yoruichi Shihouin','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I see. So this is the heart.','author'=>'Ulquiorra Cifer','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If something cannot be seen with these eyes, it does not exist.','author'=>'Ulquiorra Cifer','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Where is your pride now, soul reaper?','author'=>'Ulquiorra Cifer','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Fear is a sign that you understand the situation.','author'=>'Ulquiorra Cifer','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If anything is eternal, it would be the heart.','author'=>'Ulquiorra Cifer','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'You think you\'re hot stuff? Fine. Prove it.','author'=>'Grimmjow Jaegerjaquez','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll claw my way to the top, even if I have to do it alone.','author'=>'Grimmjow Jaegerjaquez','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t get cocky. I\'m not done with you yet.','author'=>'Grimmjow Jaegerjaquez','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pride is the only thing I have. So I\'m going to win.','author'=>'Grimmjow Jaegerjaquez','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Fear me. Hate me. Just don\'t ignore me.','author'=>'Grimmjow Jaegerjaquez','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'The world cannot be measured by reason alone.','author'=>'Coyote Starrk','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Loneliness was so powerful it could split me in two.','author'=>'Coyote Starrk','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s not about how strong you are. It\'s about who you stand beside.','author'=>'Coyote Starrk','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Sacrifice is the proof of conviction.','author'=>'Tier Harribel','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I do not fight for myself. I fight for those I shield.','author'=>'Tier Harribel','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'You don\'t have to be perfect to be loved.','author'=>'Nelliel Tu Odelschwanck','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'All things in the universe turn to ash.','author'=>'Genryusai Yamamoto','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Reduce all creation to ashes, Ryujin Jakka.','author'=>'Genryusai Yamamoto','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'An old man\'s duty is to die where his pupils will see him.','author'=>'Genryusai Yamamoto','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'There is no such thing as a battle without sacrifice.','author'=>'Shunsui Kyoraku','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'The strongest swords cut quietly.','author'=>'Shunsui Kyoraku','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I dislike fighting. But I\'ll do it because someone has to.','author'=>'Shunsui Kyoraku','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pride is a Quincy\'s strength. Without it, we are nothing.','author'=>'Uryu Ishida','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t let your pride drag you to the grave.','author'=>'Uryu Ishida','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If I have to die fighting, then so be it — but I won\'t kneel.','author'=>'Uryu Ishida','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I reject the world I once accepted.','author'=>'Orihime Inoue','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I want to save him. Even if I can\'t be saved myself.','author'=>'Orihime Inoue','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If I could be the rain, I would fall on the people I love.','author'=>'Orihime Inoue','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If you must fight, fight to protect.','author'=>'Yasutora Sado','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t need to win. I just need to stand long enough.','author'=>'Yasutora Sado','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll keep getting up. That\'s all I have to do.','author'=>'Yasutora Sado','source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Bleach away the sins. Stand again.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'A soul without resolve is just a body.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t look at the world as it is. Cut it into what it should be.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'The dead do not return. The living must do enough for both.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Power is the silence after the strike.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Pride dies last. Then the soul dies.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Hollow or soul, the same fire makes both move.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'If your blade can\'t speak, your soul has nothing to say.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],
    ['text'=>'Walk through hell. Don\'t pose for photographs on the way.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Bleach','category'=>'bleach'],

    // ── vinland_saga (67) ──
    ['text'=>'A true warrior does not need a sword.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'You have no enemies. No one has any enemies. There is no one you should hurt.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Real strength is the will to refuse to harm.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Strength is not about being able to take a life. It is about being able to refuse to take one.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A man cannot be brave if he is afraid of being kind.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Even in war, a warrior who lays down his sword is the strongest.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Walk away with your head high. That is courage.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Take care of yourself. Stay true to your heart.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I want you to be a great warrior — not the kind who kills, but the kind who never has to.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Promise me you\'ll grow up to be a true warrior.','author'=>'Thors','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I will kill him. With my own hands. With honor.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A warrior\'s duel is fought, even when nobody is watching.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'There is no point in revenge if I have to lower myself to do it.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I will not run. I will not hide. I will earn it.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Hatred is a heavy sword to swing.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I have no enemies.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'There is a place far from here. No slaves. No war. We\'ll go there together.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I will not raise my fist. Not anymore.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I want to build a country with no warriors.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Even in chains, a man can choose what kind of man he becomes.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'The path forward isn\'t about who I beat. It\'s about who I refuse to become.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'If I have to fight, I fight to keep someone alive — not to take.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A man has nothing if he loses his reasons.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to build a place where no one has to suffer the way we did.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Forgive yourself. Then keep walking.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I want to live. Really live — not just survive.','author'=>'Thorfinn','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A warrior dies on his feet, not in his sleep.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'What is a warrior without his sword? Bones, no different from the rest of us.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'The world bends. Survive it, and you\'ll bend it back.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s foolish to expect mercy. Plan around its absence.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Even a wolf needs friends to survive a long winter.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Hate is fuel. Don\'t drink it. Burn it.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I would have liked to die under that sky.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m tired of seeing my men die for someone else\'s idea of glory.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A king has to be the kind of man no one wants to be.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'There are wolves in this world, and there are sheep. Decide quickly.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Cunning is just another kind of strength.','author'=>'Askeladd','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A true king must endure for the sake of his people, even when it costs him his soul.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'If paradise exists, I must build it here.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Love is the cause of all suffering. So I will rule.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I will save the world, even if it damns me.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'The dead don\'t ask for crowns. The living must wear them.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A king is the man who decides for everyone — and is hated for it.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'I do not seek paradise in the sky. I seek it here, on this dirt.','author'=>'Canute','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Even on this land, the wheat grows. Even after war, life returns.','author'=>'Einar','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A field needs blood, sweat, and patience — same as a man.','author'=>'Einar','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Each seed is a promise to the future.','author'=>'Einar','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Slavery only ends when you decide it ends for you.','author'=>'Einar','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'If we keep working, we will own this ground one day.','author'=>'Einar','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A free man is one who knows how to feed himself.','author'=>'Einar','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Death pays no debts. Only the living do.','author'=>'Snake','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'A sword is just a tool. It is the hand behind it that matters.','author'=>'Snake','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Keep walking long enough and even the worst days fade.','author'=>'Snake','source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Vinland — a land where no slaves walk and no swords fall.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Every man who lives by the sword carries a coffin he cannot put down.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'The bravest warrior is the one who lays down his blade and walks away.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes the strongest move is to plant, not to strike.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'We were soldiers because we had no land. Give us land and watch us bloom.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Hatred is heavy. Forgiveness is heavier.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Even a slave can have a sky.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'The man who lives twice is the one who refused revenge once.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'We cross oceans not to escape — but to begin again.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'If Valhalla welcomes only warriors, build a different paradise.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'There is no peace until a man stops fighting himself.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Some men live by the blade. Better men outlive it.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Mercy is not weakness. It is mastery.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],
    ['text'=>'Walk away with empty hands. They will fill themselves with better things.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Vinland Saga','category'=>'vinland_saga'],

    // ── misfits (162) ──
    ['text'=>'I\'m just an ordinary middle-schooler. But I have to keep trying.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Just because you have powers doesn\'t mean you\'re better than anyone.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Everyone has their own life. Everyone is the protagonist of their own story.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t put in the effort, you\'ll never improve.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Self-confidence doesn\'t come from powers. It comes from action.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Pleasure doesn\'t come from being the strongest. It comes from being kind.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t use my powers on people. That\'s my one rule.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I am only an ordinary kid. But I\'m trying to be a good one.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Improvement only happens if you act in the present.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even if you have power, you can still be small inside.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Anyone can change. Even you. Even me.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Talent isn\'t everything. The work you put in is.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Each day, I try a little harder. That\'s all I can do.','author'=>'Shigeo "Mob" Kageyama','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Take it slow. Just start.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t insult the everyday lives of people who try their hardest.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you have an unfair advantage, you should use it for good. Otherwise, what\'s the point?','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Being weak isn\'t shameful. Being unkind is.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Adults aren\'t supposed to bully kids — that goes for psychics too.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You don\'t need superpowers to be a good person.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Live your life with confidence. Even if you\'re faking it.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Make today better than yesterday. That\'s the only goal.','author'=>'Reigen Arataka','source'=>'Mob Psycho 100','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I never go back on my word. That\'s my nindo, my ninja way.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Hard work is worthless for those who don\'t believe in themselves.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When people are protecting something truly special, they truly can become as strong as they can be.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s not the face that makes someone a monster. It\'s the choices they make with their life.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t like your destiny, don\'t accept it.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Believe it.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Failure is just another chance to begin.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to be Hokage no matter what.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you\'ve got time to fantasize about a beautiful end, just live beautifully till the end.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t sit there and complain. Get up. Do something.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even if it takes a thousand attempts, I\'ll keep trying.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t run away. I never go back on my word.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Talent is just an excuse for those who don\'t want to work.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t take a chance, your life won\'t go anywhere.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to live up to people\'s expectations of me.','author'=>'Naruto Uzumaki','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'A teacher who gives up on his students has no right to be a teacher.','author'=>'Iruka Umino','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Where there is light, there is shadow.','author'=>'Iruka Umino','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When people get hurt, they learn to hate. When they hurt others, they understand pain.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'The one who forgives a friend\'s mistake is the one who is truly strong.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'A man becomes a true man only when he is willing to die for his beliefs.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Anyone can be a sage. It\'s just a matter of effort.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'A novel where the hero never gives up is what makes a real story.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even the strongest of opponents always has a weakness.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Knowledge alone is not enough — character matters more.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Failing to make a name for yourself is itself the path of a true student.','author'=>'Jiraiya','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'In the ninja world, those who don\'t follow the rules are trash, but those who abandon their friends are worse than trash.','author'=>'Kakashi Hatake','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When a person has something important they want to protect, that\'s when they can become truly strong.','author'=>'Haku','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Hard work and effort can defeat genius.','author'=>'Rock Lee','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you can\'t be a genius, work harder than one.','author'=>'Rock Lee','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather die fighting than run.','author'=>'Rock Lee','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Plants need both sunshine and rain to grow.','author'=>'Itachi Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You don\'t become Hokage to be acknowledged. You become Hokage to protect those who acknowledge you.','author'=>'Itachi Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'We don\'t know what kind of person we\'ll be once everything we love is gone.','author'=>'Itachi Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'People live their lives bound by what they accept as correct and true.','author'=>'Itachi Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Forgive me, Sasuke. This is it.','author'=>'Itachi Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'The pain of being alone is not an easy one to bear.','author'=>'Pain','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you want to know what pain is, you must understand it.','author'=>'Pain','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Wherever there is light, there are also shadows.','author'=>'Madara Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Power is not will. It is the phenomenon of physically making things happen.','author'=>'Madara Uchiha','source'=>'Naruto','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Plus Ultra!','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Whether you win or lose, looking back and reflecting on your performance is a way to prepare for the next fight.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Meddling when you don\'t need to is the essence of a hero.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When there\'s nothing to be done, that\'s when a real hero shows up.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You can become a hero.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I am here.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes I do feel like a fraud, but I can\'t let those doubts stop me.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s not the size of the body. It\'s the size of the heart that matters.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Young man — your story has only just begun.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Go beyond.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'A real hero saves both lives and spirits.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes the hero is the kid who keeps standing up.','author'=>'All Might','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you feel yourself hitting up against your limit, remember why you clenched your fist in the first place.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to be a hero who saves people with a fearless smile.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I am here to save the people who need saving.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even the impossible has a path. I just have to find it.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If I can do something now, I\'d better do it.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You can do it.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to know what kind of person I can become.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll save you. Even if I die doing it.','author'=>'Izuku "Deku" Midoriya','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you want to be number one, you have to stop crying and run.','author'=>'Katsuki Bakugo','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Stop running away from yourself.','author'=>'Katsuki Bakugo','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to be number one. So step aside.','author'=>'Katsuki Bakugo','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Pride and victory aren\'t the same thing.','author'=>'Katsuki Bakugo','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to surpass you, you damn nerd.','author'=>'Katsuki Bakugo','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t ever forget where you started.','author'=>'Shota Aizawa','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Logical ruses can change the tide of battle.','author'=>'Shota Aizawa','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t say goodbye. That\'s a shameful word.','author'=>'Shota Aizawa','source'=>'My Hero Academia','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'No matter how many people you may lose, you have no choice but to go on living.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'It doesn\'t matter how hard it is, or how painful — just go on living.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I will keep moving forward. Whatever happens, I will keep moving forward.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Total concentration breathing.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Forget yesterday. Step forward.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t let your kindness be the death of you. But never lose it.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'The bond between siblings cannot be broken by anyone.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you fall, get up.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I will become the strongest demon slayer.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you bury yourself in self-pity, you bury yourself.','author'=>'Tanjiro Kamado','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Set your heart ablaze.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When you have a strong heart, no matter what kind of difficulty befalls you, you can overcome it.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Be strong. Be a person who protects.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t be discouraged. Stand back up. Set your heart ablaze.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I trust in the strength of every person I meet.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t have any regrets.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When you carry the lives of others on your shoulders, you cannot be reckless.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I trust in the strength of those left behind.','author'=>'Kyojuro Rengoku','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even the weak can become strong if they keep trying.','author'=>'Zenitsu Agatsuma','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m useless. But I\'ll do whatever I can.','author'=>'Zenitsu Agatsuma','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even cowards can be heroes — at least once.','author'=>'Zenitsu Agatsuma','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m here. Even if I\'m shaking, I\'m here.','author'=>'Zenitsu Agatsuma','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll fight. I don\'t care if I lose.','author'=>'Zenitsu Agatsuma','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you can\'t beat your enemy, become someone they can\'t beat.','author'=>'Inosuke Hashibira','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t apologize. Get stronger.','author'=>'Inosuke Hashibira','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If I push myself a little more today, tomorrow I\'ll be ready.','author'=>'Inosuke Hashibira','source'=>'Demon Slayer','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Throughout heaven and earth, I alone am the honored one.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'The strongest doesn\'t lose. And I don\'t lose because I\'m the strongest.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Get angry. Don\'t ever forget the way you feel right now.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Show me with your strength how that hatred translates into action.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even if I\'m alone — I\'m the strongest.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Adapt. The fight isn\'t over.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Be the kind of person that knows when to hold back, and when to let loose.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If something has no value, then assign it some.','author'=>'Satoru Gojo','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If I keep moving forward, I can save someone.','author'=>'Yuji Itadori','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to surround myself with kind people in the end.','author'=>'Yuji Itadori','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to help as many people as I can.','author'=>'Yuji Itadori','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even when scared out of my mind, I\'ll save people.','author'=>'Yuji Itadori','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If I don\'t act now, regret will eat me later.','author'=>'Yuji Itadori','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You owe nothing to a stranger — but I\'ll save them anyway.','author'=>'Yuji Itadori','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Hold up, hold up. Make the right call.','author'=>'Megumi Fushiguro','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I am no hero. I just don\'t want to live with regrets.','author'=>'Megumi Fushiguro','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Save the people you can save. That\'s all.','author'=>'Megumi Fushiguro','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not nice. I just choose to help when I can.','author'=>'Megumi Fushiguro','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You are a sorcerer. Live like one. Die like one.','author'=>'Megumi Fushiguro','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Domain expansion.','author'=>'Megumi Fushiguro','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather get punched a thousand times than back down once.','author'=>'Nobara Kugisaki','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I am Kugisaki Nobara. And I am not less than anyone.','author'=>'Nobara Kugisaki','source'=>'Jujutsu Kaisen','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not going to leave you behind. Period.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Even if you don\'t have a goal, just walking is fun.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to meet the man who left me. That\'s enough.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t take risks, you can\'t create a future.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes you have to fight, but not to win — just to keep going.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to be like my dad. Free, strong, kind.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When you decide on something, you have to give everything.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather lose myself than give up.','author'=>'Gon Freecss','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'An assassin\'s first lesson: do not hesitate.','author'=>'Killua Zoldyck','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t want to be a killer. I want to be Gon\'s friend.','author'=>'Killua Zoldyck','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'If you say you\'re going to do something, then do it.','author'=>'Killua Zoldyck','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Trust someone — really trust them — and your world expands.','author'=>'Killua Zoldyck','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t need to be the strongest. I just need to be standing when it matters.','author'=>'Killua Zoldyck','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'When you do something noble — there\'s no need to brag about it.','author'=>'Killua Zoldyck','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Risk it all. Otherwise you can\'t win.','author'=>'Hisoka Morow','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'You learn nothing from those weaker than you.','author'=>'Hisoka Morow','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Save the ripe fruit for later. Patience is a weapon too.','author'=>'Hisoka Morow','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes the difference between victory and defeat is the speed of your conviction.','author'=>'Netero','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Train as if your life depends on the next strike. Because someday it will.','author'=>'Netero','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Gratitude is repaid in service. Not words.','author'=>'Netero','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'The strength to act is born from gratitude.','author'=>'Netero','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t ever lose to yourself.','author'=>'Kurapika','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I will not falter. I will not break.','author'=>'Kurapika','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Sometimes vengeance is a slow walk through hell.','author'=>'Kurapika','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'Money rules the world.','author'=>'Leorio','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],
    ['text'=>'I want to be a doctor — not for fame, but for those who can\'t pay.','author'=>'Leorio','source'=>'Hunter x Hunter','category'=>'misfits'],

    // ── anime (168) ──
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t take risks, you can\'t create a future.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to be the King of the Pirates!','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'When do you think people die? When they are shot? No. When they are forgotten.','author'=>'Dr. Hiriluk','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Only those who have suffered long can find the way out of the pit of despair.','author'=>'Brook','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'There is no greater crime than not avenging a friend.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Inherited will, the destiny of the age, and the dreams of the people. These are things that will not be stopped.','author'=>'Gol D. Roger','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t take risks, you can\'t create a future. Don\'t preach to me about pirates.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Being weak isn\'t a crime. Staying weak when you can change is.','author'=>'Roronoa Zoro','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I have no intention of dying. I want to be the greatest swordsman.','author'=>'Roronoa Zoro','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If I die here, I\'m just a man who could only make it this far.','author'=>'Roronoa Zoro','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll surpass even you. My sword will become legend.','author'=>'Roronoa Zoro','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Nothing happens to people who do nothing.','author'=>'Nico Robin','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I want to live!','author'=>'Nico Robin','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If I have to be selfish to save them, then I\'ll be selfish.','author'=>'Sanji','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I won\'t kick a woman. But I won\'t kneel either.','author'=>'Sanji','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Justice will prevail, you say? But of course it will! Whoever wins this war becomes justice!','author'=>'Donquixote Doflamingo','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The world is not perfect. But it is. So accept it. It\'s all you have.','author'=>'Roronoa Zoro','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Pirates do not pirate to live — they live to pirate.','author'=>'Whitebeard','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Sons! Make some noise!','author'=>'Whitebeard','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Some idiot tried to take my crown. So I told him to come and get it.','author'=>'Whitebeard','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I owe you nothing. But I\'ll save you anyway.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Hero — I don\'t want to be one. A pirate is what I am.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t tell me what I can\'t do.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll always trust my crew, even when the world says I shouldn\'t.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Power without dreams is just noise.','author'=>'Monkey D. Luffy','source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Live well. Eat well. Sail far. That is the pirate\'s creed.','author'=>null,'source'=>'One Piece','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Push yourself past your limits, because that\'s where you find your true strength.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you ever forget how to fight, I\'ll be there to remind you.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s the duty of the strong to protect the weak.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am the hope of the universe. I am the answer to all living things that cry out for peace.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m Saiyan raised on Earth — and I\'ll do what no one else can.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t think. Feel.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'You\'re going to pay for what you\'ve done.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather be a brainless monkey than a heartless monster.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Train until you collapse — then train some more.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Strength alone won\'t save you. Heart will.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am the prince of all Saiyans, once again!','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I do not fear this new challenge. Rather, like a true warrior, I will rise to meet it.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Push through the pain. Giving up hurts more.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s over 9000!','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'You think you\'re better than me? Prove it.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A true Saiyan is one who knows no limits.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Defeat is just another teacher. Listen and stand again.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Pride drives me. Loss humbles me. Both make me stronger.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am the strongest there is.','author'=>'Vegeta','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Kamehameha.','author'=>'Goku','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Even a moment\'s hesitation can cost you the fight.','author'=>'Piccolo','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t run from death. So look it in the eye.','author'=>'Piccolo','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Train smarter. Train harder. Or step aside.','author'=>'Piccolo','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'When pushed to the brink, your real power emerges.','author'=>'Gohan','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I don\'t fight for myself. I fight for the people I love.','author'=>'Gohan','source'=>'Dragon Ball','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you can\'t grasp even one tiny dream, you can\'t become anything.','author'=>'Griffith','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A friend is someone who is equal to me, who doesn\'t have to depend on me.','author'=>'Griffith','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'True bravery is to live, and only die when fate demands it.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll keep moving forward, even if my whole body is broken.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A man fights so he doesn\'t have to die. So that he doesn\'t have to live like a corpse.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If the world has rules, I\'ll break them.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The way you should live. The path you should take. You have to decide that for yourself.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Do not stand alone. There will always be someone who has your back.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not asking for much. Just to be alive.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The grip of armor. The weight of a sword. The breath of a beast. Some live for these.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'In this world, is the destiny of mankind controlled by some transcendental entity or law? Is it like the hand of God?','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Every act, every word, every breath — drag yourself forward.','author'=>'Guts','source'=>'Berserk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A lesson without pain is meaningless. You cannot gain something without sacrificing something else in return.','author'=>'Edward Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Stand up and walk. Keep moving forward. You\'ve got two good legs. So get up and use them.','author'=>'Edward Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Humankind cannot gain anything without first giving something in return.','author'=>'Alphonse Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'To obtain, something of equal value must be lost.','author'=>'Alphonse Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'There\'s no such thing as a painless lesson.','author'=>'Edward Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s a terrible day for rain.','author'=>'Roy Mustang','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am a human being. I will live as one.','author'=>'Edward Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The world isn\'t perfect. But it\'s there for us, doing the best it can.','author'=>'Alphonse Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A small voice that no one ever hears can change history forever.','author'=>'Edward Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'There are no losers, only those who haven\'t won yet.','author'=>'Roy Mustang','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A lot of pain doesn\'t change the fact that we keep going.','author'=>'Riza Hawkeye','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Standing in the ashes of a tens of thousands of dead folks, and asking ourselves: \'how can it be a sin to die for the country I love?\'','author'=>'Roy Mustang','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t dwell on the past. Today is today.','author'=>'Edward Elric','source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Brothers fight. Brothers forgive. Brothers walk forward together.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Fullmetal Alchemist','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If the king does not move, then his subjects will not follow.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The only ones who should kill are those prepared to be killed.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I shall obliterate the world, and create a new one.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Yes, I destroy the world. And I create it anew.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The world cannot be changed with pretty words alone.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I shall take everything upon myself. So you may live free.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'There are two kinds of fools — those who can\'t take action, and those who can only take action.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'To defeat evil, I must become a greater evil.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Discrimination, war, the unfairness of life — I\'ll bring it all down.','author'=>'Lelouch vi Britannia','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'All hail Lelouch.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A lie cannot last forever.','author'=>'Suzaku Kururugi','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Means do matter. The wrong path doesn\'t lead to the right place.','author'=>'Suzaku Kururugi','source'=>'Code Geass','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll take a potato chip… and eat it.','author'=>'Light Yagami','source'=>'Death Note','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Justice will prevail.','author'=>'Light Yagami','source'=>'Death Note','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you can\'t win the game, change the rules.','author'=>'Light Yagami','source'=>'Death Note','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'L. Do you know shinigami love apples?','author'=>'Ryuk','source'=>'Death Note','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The world is rotten. So I\'m going to fix it.','author'=>'Light Yagami','source'=>'Death Note','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you cling to your method too tightly, you become the thing you hated.','author'=>'L','source'=>'Death Note','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Whatever happens, happens.','author'=>'Spike Spiegel','source'=>'Cowboy Bebop','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m just watching a bad dream I never wake up from.','author'=>'Spike Spiegel','source'=>'Cowboy Bebop','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'You\'re going to carry that weight.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Cowboy Bebop','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Bang.','author'=>'Spike Spiegel','source'=>'Cowboy Bebop','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I make my own future. Even if it\'s small.','author'=>'Faye Valentine','source'=>'Cowboy Bebop','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not the protagonist of a novel or anything. I\'m a university student who likes to read.','author'=>'Ken Kaneki','source'=>'Tokyo Ghoul','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s better to be hurt than to hurt others.','author'=>'Ken Kaneki','source'=>'Tokyo Ghoul','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If, for argument\'s sake, you were to write a story with me in the lead role, it would be a tragedy.','author'=>'Ken Kaneki','source'=>'Tokyo Ghoul','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am no longer the prey. I am the hunter.','author'=>'Ken Kaneki','source'=>'Tokyo Ghoul','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'This is the choice of Steins Gate.','author'=>'Rintaro Okabe','source'=>'Steins;Gate','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'El psy congroo.','author'=>'Rintaro Okabe','source'=>'Steins;Gate','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am Hououin Kyouma — and I will rewrite fate itself.','author'=>'Rintaro Okabe','source'=>'Steins;Gate','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'We are walking down a path full of regret. But every step, we are still walking.','author'=>'Rintaro Okabe','source'=>'Steins;Gate','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Strong are not those who never lose, but those who keep getting up.','author'=>'Takamura','source'=>'Hajime no Ippo','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Effort doesn\'t betray.','author'=>'Takamura','source'=>'Hajime no Ippo','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'When you train, train to bleed.','author'=>'Takamura','source'=>'Hajime no Ippo','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Is it weak to throw a punch and miss? No. Weakness is not throwing.','author'=>'Takamura','source'=>'Hajime no Ippo','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'What does it mean to be strong?','author'=>'Makunouchi Ippo','source'=>'Hajime no Ippo','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The sword and the path are one.','author'=>'Miyamoto Musashi','source'=>'Vagabond','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Invincible under the sun.','author'=>'Miyamoto Musashi','source'=>'Vagabond','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t seek perfection. Seek progress, every single day.','author'=>'Miyamoto Musashi','source'=>'Vagabond','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I will not run. I will not lose. I am alive.','author'=>'Miyamoto Musashi','source'=>'Vagabond','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The moment you think \'oh I\'m gonna lose\', that\'s the moment you lose.','author'=>'Shoyo Hinata','source'=>'Haikyuu','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you\'re going to hit it, hit it until it breaks.','author'=>'Tobio Kageyama','source'=>'Haikyuu','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Talents are blossomed. Skills are built. Hard work is non-negotiable.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Haikyuu','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The game\'s not over until I say it is.','author'=>'Hanamichi Sakuragi','source'=>'Slam Dunk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Left hand is just for support.','author'=>'Hanamichi Sakuragi','source'=>'Slam Dunk','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Get in the robot, Shinji.','author'=>'Gendo Ikari','source'=>'Neon Genesis Evangelion','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I mustn\'t run away.','author'=>'Shinji Ikari','source'=>'Neon Genesis Evangelion','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Congratulations.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Neon Genesis Evangelion','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t worry. Trust me.','author'=>'Misato Katsuragi','source'=>'Neon Genesis Evangelion','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Take this drill, Simon. Believe in the you who believes in yourself!','author'=>'Kamina','source'=>'Gurren Lagann','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Who the hell do you think I am?','author'=>'Kamina','source'=>'Gurren Lagann','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Pierce the heavens.','author'=>'Kamina','source'=>'Gurren Lagann','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Just who the hell do you think we are?','author'=>'Simon','source'=>'Gurren Lagann','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Row, row, fight the power!','author'=>null,'source'=>'Gurren Lagann','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'What\'s done is done. Now go forward.','author'=>'Holo','source'=>'Spice and Wolf','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I am the bone of my sword.','author'=>'Shirou Emiya','source'=>'Fate/stay night','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Steel is my body, fire is my blood.','author'=>'Shirou Emiya','source'=>'Fate/stay night','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'People die when they are killed.','author'=>'Shirou Emiya','source'=>'Fate/stay night','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A king does not stand alone. But a king does stand first.','author'=>'Gilgamesh','source'=>'Fate/stay night','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you don\'t try, then you can\'t fail. But you can\'t win either.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Fate/Zero','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Even a single life is worth saving — that is what a hero believes.','author'=>'Kiritsugu Emiya','source'=>'Fate/Zero','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Anything to win.','author'=>'Kiritsugu Emiya','source'=>'Fate/Zero','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'You can\'t change the past. But the future is yours.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Erased','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Even the worst day ends.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Erased','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'All I have to do is study, sleep, and live.','author'=>'Saiki Kusuo','source'=>'The Disastrous Life of Saiki K.','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Even the strongest power is useless if you don\'t act.','author'=>'Saitama','source'=>'One Punch Man','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you stay in your comfort zone, you\'ll never know how strong you can be.','author'=>'Saitama','source'=>'One Punch Man','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'OK. One punch.','author'=>'Saitama','source'=>'One Punch Man','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I just want to enjoy a quiet life.','author'=>'Saitama','source'=>'One Punch Man','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If a hero can\'t endure, who can?','author'=>'Saitama','source'=>'One Punch Man','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m not a hero because I want your approval. I do it because I want to.','author'=>'Saitama','source'=>'One Punch Man','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Dreams require sweat, not just speeches.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The flag you raise is the world you live for.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you can\'t pick yourself up, drag yourself forward.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t dishonor the time the dead gave you.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Every protagonist was once a side character with a stubborn heart.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The strongest fighters were once kids with too many doubts.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you train in silence, your results will speak loud.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Even gods fall when their resolve cracks.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'There is no shortcut to the next level.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'A coward dies a thousand times before the final blow.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Power is responsibility, in either uniform.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The path of mastery is paved with bruises.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Win or learn — those are the only options.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Pain in training is celebration in battle.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'An ordinary day is a gift the heroes never had.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Heroes don\'t run from the dark. They light it.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'If you\'re going to bleed, bleed for something.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Even the smallest spark can set the whole sky on fire.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'The arc that nobody applauds is the one that matters.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],
    ['text'=>'Become the protagonist of your own life. There is no other story.','author'=>null,'source'=>'Anime','category'=>'anime'],

    // ── movie (242) ──
    ['text'=>'It ain\'t about how hard you hit. It\'s about how hard you can get hit and keep moving forward.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky Balboa','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Going one more round when you don\'t think you can — that\'s what makes all the difference in your life.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky V','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Nobody owes nobody nothing. You owe yourself.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky Balboa','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'If I can change, and you can change, everybody can change.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky IV','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Yo Adrian, I did it!','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky II','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Until you start believing in yourself, you ain\'t gonna have a life.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky Balboa','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s your right to listen to your gut. It ain\'t nobody\'s right to say no after you earn the right to be where you want to be.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Rocky Balboa','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Eye of the tiger, kid.','author'=>'Mickey Goldmill','source'=>'Rocky III','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'You gotta get mean, kid. Mean.','author'=>'Mickey Goldmill','source'=>'Rocky','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'One step at a time. One punch at a time. One round at a time.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Creed','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'If I fight, you fight.','author'=>'Rocky Balboa','source'=>'Creed','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Don\'t ever let somebody tell you you can\'t do something. Not even me.','author'=>'Chris Gardner','source'=>'The Pursuit of Happyness','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'You got a dream, you gotta protect it.','author'=>'Chris Gardner','source'=>'The Pursuit of Happyness','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'People can\'t do something themselves, they want to tell you you can\'t do it.','author'=>'Chris Gardner','source'=>'The Pursuit of Happyness','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'If you want something, go get it. Period.','author'=>'Chris Gardner','source'=>'The Pursuit of Happyness','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'What we do in life echoes in eternity.','author'=>'Maximus','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Are you not entertained?','author'=>'Maximus','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'My name is Maximus Decimus Meridius, commander of the Armies of the North, General of the Felix Legions… and I will have my vengeance, in this life or the next.','author'=>'Maximus','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Strength and honor.','author'=>'Maximus','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Brothers, what we do in life echoes in eternity.','author'=>'Maximus','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Death smiles at us all. All a man can do is smile back.','author'=>'Marcus Aurelius','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Your fame is well deserved, Spaniard.','author'=>'Commodus','source'=>'Gladiator','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'There are no two words in the English language more harmful than \'good job.\'','author'=>'Terence Fletcher','source'=>'Whiplash','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather die drunk, broke at 34 and have people at a dinner table talk about me than live to be rich and sober at 90 and nobody remembered who I was.','author'=>'Andrew Neiman','source'=>'Whiplash','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Not quite my tempo.','author'=>'Terence Fletcher','source'=>'Whiplash','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'If you wanna be one of the greats, you\'ve gotta give up the safe option.','author'=>'Terence Fletcher','source'=>'Whiplash','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I\'ll earn it. Drum by drum. Hour by hour.','author'=>'Andrew Neiman','source'=>'Whiplash','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I\'d rather burn out than not be seen.','author'=>'Andrew Neiman','source'=>'Whiplash','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'It\'s only after we\'ve lost everything that we\'re free to do anything.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'You are not your job. You are not how much money you have in the bank.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'The things you own end up owning you.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Stop trying to control everything and just let go.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I want you to hit me as hard as you can.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'This is your life, and it\'s ending one minute at a time.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'We\'ve all been raised on television to believe that one day we\'d all be millionaires.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'The first rule of Fight Club is — you do not talk about Fight Club.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'You\'re not your khakis.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'On a long enough timeline, the survival rate for everyone drops to zero.','author'=>'The Narrator','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Without pain, without sacrifice, we would have nothing.','author'=>'Tyler Durden','source'=>'Fight Club','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Get busy living, or get busy dying.','author'=>'Andy Dufresne','source'=>'The Shawshank Redemption','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Hope is a good thing, maybe the best of things, and no good thing ever dies.','author'=>'Andy Dufresne','source'=>'The Shawshank Redemption','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Remember Red, hope is a good thing.','author'=>'Andy Dufresne','source'=>'The Shawshank Redemption','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I guess it comes down to a simple choice, really. Get busy living, or get busy dying.','author'=>'Andy Dufresne','source'=>'The Shawshank Redemption','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Salvation lies within.','author'=>'Warden Norton','source'=>'The Shawshank Redemption','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I find I\'m so excited I can barely sit still or hold a thought in my head.','author'=>'Red','source'=>'The Shawshank Redemption','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'The path of the righteous man is beset on all sides by the inequities of the selfish and the tyranny of evil men.','author'=>'Jules Winnfield','source'=>'Pulp Fiction','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Say what again. I dare you.','author'=>'Jules Winnfield','source'=>'Pulp Fiction','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Bring out the gimp.','author'=>'Maynard','source'=>'Pulp Fiction','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'I\'m going to get medieval on your ass.','author'=>'Marsellus Wallace','source'=>'Pulp Fiction','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Pride only hurts. It never helps.','author'=>'Marsellus Wallace','source'=>'Pulp Fiction','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'Royale with cheese.','author'=>'Vincent Vega','source'=>'Pulp Fiction','category'=>'movie'],
    ['text'=>'All we have to decide is what to do with the time that is given us.','author'=>'Gandalf','source'=>'The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring','category'=>'movie'],
